  "features": [
    "Valid confirmed panel edits apply and save locally; saved settings automatically restore after restart. No separate Apply action or unsaved-draft status.",
    "Current-compatible fields apply now; opening resources, first-round manpower and initial wait apply next match. Recruitment and selection-AI switches apply now and persist for future matches.",
    "Undo reapplies the previous rules; restore defaults resets all exposed parameters while retaining approved hit/lifetime improvements. Neither rewinds battle state, clears troops or deletes named presets.",
    "Spawn and clear controls follow the match summary; common rules precede red/blue status. Returning to the main menu ends combat but keeps settings.",
    "Named presets are optional copies. Loading and importing apply immediately; JSON exports are backups/exchanges, not battle saves.",
    "50x and 100x shortcuts and a 0-100 input range retain complete 30 Hz logic, the independent 240 FPS target and 8 ms/24-step accelerated-work guard."
  ],
